@host = http://localhost:5094

### 1) Create shipment
POST {{host}}/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Ali Yilmaz",
  "address": "Aydin, Turkey",
  "phoneNumber": "05550000000",
  "packageInfo": "Small box",
  "email": null,
  "createdBy": "employee-1"
}

### Replace tracking number below after create
@trackingNumber = SHP-REPLACE-ME

### 2) Team lookup
GET {{host}}/api/shipments/{{trackingNumber}}

### 3) List
GET {{host}}/api/shipments

### 4) Filter
GET {{host}}/api/shipments?status=Preparing

### 5) Change status
PUT {{host}}/api/shipments/{{trackingNumber}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": "Shipped",
  "changedBy": "employee-1"
}

### 6) Invalid transition example -> should return 409 if current state does not allow Delivered
PUT {{host}}/api/shipments/{{trackingNumber}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": "Delivered",
  "changedBy": "employee-1"
}

### 7) Customer read-only tracking
GET {{host}}/api/tracking/{{trackingNumber}}
